-  r_{(Y')}:X_{(Y')}\to P'=\bb{P}(\sh{E}')
-\]
-tương ứng với $\vphi_{(Y')}:q_{(Y')}^*(\sh{E}')=q^*(\sh{E})\otimes_Y\sh{O}_{Y'}\to\sh{L}\otimes_Y\sh{O}_{Y'}$.
