-\resizebox{\textwidth}{!}{$
-  (T_{r}^{s})^{p}(A_1,\ldots;B_1,\ldots)
-  \times
-  (T_{s}^{r})^{n-p}(B_1,\ldots;A_1,\ldots,A_r\otimes\Omega_X^{n})
